mvn clean install

Step 7: Configure PostgreSQL

Step 7: Configure PostgreSQL

Open:

src/main/resources/application.properties

Replace its contents with:

spring.application.name=vegetable-backend

server.port=8080

spring.datasource.url=jdbc:postgresql://localhost:5432/vegetable_db
spring.datasource.username=veguser
spring.datasource.password=StrongPassword

spring.jpa.hibernate.ddl-auto=update
spring.jpa.show-sql=true
spring.jpa.properties.hibernate.format_sql=true

spring.jpa.database-platform=org.hibernate.dialect.PostgreSQLDialect

If PostgreSQL is on another server, replace localhost with its IP or hostname.

