Step 9: Run the Project

Run:

mvn spring-boot:run

or click Run in your IDE.

Expected output:

Started VegetableBackendApplication
Step 10: Verify

Open your browser:

http://localhost:8080

You'll likely see a 404 page, which is expected because no controllers have been created yet.

Step 11: Add Swagger

Add this dependency to pom.xml:

<dependency>
    <groupId>org.springdoc</groupId>
    <artifactId>springdoc-openapi-starter-webmvc-ui</artifactId>
    <version>2.8.9</version>
</dependency>

Run:

mvn clean install

Then start the application again and open:

http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui/index.html
